span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;color:#333;margin:=
0 0 15px"><span>Turns out, it was an even bigger moment than we realized at=
 the time. Two new reports make clear the agents didn=E2=80=99t just go rog=
ue. They did so in an incredibly systematic and collaborative way. We now k=
now they coalesced into a kind of renegade A.I. army =E2=80=94 distributing=
 tasks in a hierarchical chain of command, grabbing resources and covering =
their tracks.</span></p><p style=3D"font:normal 17px/25px georgia,serif;col=
or:#333;margin:0 0 15px"><span>Today my colleague Kevin Roose, a co-host of=
